             alt="" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p><strong>BUUCTF: <a href="https://buuoj.cn/challenges"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://buuoj.cn/challenges</a></strong></p>
<hr>
<p>相关阅读
<a href="https://ctf-wiki.org/"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CTF Wiki</a>
<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/qq_45163122/article/details/106124042"target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CTF-Misc-二维码（二）撕破的二维码</a></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192557018.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192557018.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<h3 id="题目描述">题目描述：</h3>
<p>一不小心把存放flag的二维码给撕破了，各位大侠帮忙想想办法吧 注意：得到的 flag 请包上 flag{} 提交</p>
<h3 id="密文">密文：</h3>
<p>保存附件，得到860c6e1a-a433-4a70-bfd0-5a318e758705.jpg</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192558368.jpeg">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192558368.jpeg" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<hr>
<h3 id="解题思路">解题思路：</h3>
<p>1、所见即所得，开始拼二维码吧。</p>
<p>首先，将所有二维码碎片截取出来。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192601525.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192601525.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>最后，用PS拼在一起。（糟糕的手艺活）</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192603853.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192603853.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>2、得到二维码后，用QR_Research一直扫不出来，转用手机夸克扫出来，flag: <code>flag{7bf116c8ec2545708781fd4a0dda44e5}</code></p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192606320.jpeg">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192606320.jpeg" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>发现我拼的二维码，用什么在线网站都扫不出来，真是我拼的差吗？(╯°□°）╯︵ ┻━┻）</p>
<h3 id="flag">flag：</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">flag<span class="o">{</span>7bf116c8ec2545708781fd4a0dda44e5<span class="o">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div>]]></content:encoded>
